<BaseLayout title="Rooted Smile Tooth Powder">
  <h1>Rooted Smile Tooth Powder</h1>
  <p>Earthy, gentle, fluoride-free oral care designed for sensitive mouths.</p>

  <h2>How to use</h2>
  <ol>
    <li>Use a small spoon — do not dip the toothbrush directly into the jar.</li>
    <li>Place powder on your palm or a small dish.</li>
    <li>Touch a damp toothbrush tip to the powder.</li>
    <li>Brush gently for 2 minutes, especially along the gums.</li>
    <li>Best at night after dinner. Avoid eating afterward.</li>
    <li>Rinse the sink to avoid natural staining.</li>
  </ol>

  <a class="btn" href="/cart">Add to Cart</a>
</BaseLayout>
